# UA schedule (system knowledge)

## Where data lives

- `data/ua-schedule-2026-27.json` — date→cycle map, block rotation A–H, Brett’s teaching blocks/sequences (consult; do **not** dump full schedule UI on every page)
- `data/Ursuline_2026-27_Authoritative_Teaching_Schedule.md` — narrative authoritative reference
- `app/lib/uaSchedule.ts` — `getCycleDayLabel()`, `getCalendarEntry()`, America/New_York date keys

## Cycle start (authoritative for agents)

- **Day 0** = Thursday, **2026-09-10**
- **Day 1** = Friday, **2026-09-11** (Q1 begins)
- Later dates follow `calendar` in the JSON (Teaching Impact Calendar ledger). Special / no-numbered days → **Day 0**; no school → no nav day label.

## Nav vs full schedule

- SiteHeader shows a compact **Day N** / **Day 0** next to the date only.
- Quotes under nav hide on scroll; footer quotes stay.
- For “what am I teaching today?” read JSON `teaching.rotationSequences` + today’s `cycleDay` — do not invent a homepage schedule board unless asked.
